→ Score saved on submission
→ Student progress updated
→ Teacher analytics updated, if authorized
→ Admin analytics updated

Teacher assigns an exam:
→ Assignment saved
→ Student dashboard displays assignment
→ Teacher dashboard displays assignment
→ Admin panel reflects assignment

Implement reliable data refresh or real-time updates where appropriate.

Do not create unnecessary real-time subscriptions if normal database queries and refresh mechanisms are sufficient.

